{"id":"eventuell","lemma":"eventuell","pos":"adv","rank":2868,"glosses":["perhaps, possibly, potentially"],"ipa":"/e.vɛnˈtu̯ɛl/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/e/ee/De-eventuell.ogg/De-eventuell.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Eventuell komme ich zurück.","en":"I might be back.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/178215","words":[null,{"g":"to come","l":"kommen"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"stand back!"}]},{"text":"Ich könnte das eventuell regeln.","en":"I might be able to arrange that.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"können"},{"g":"the / that"},null,{"g":"to regulate"}]},{"text":"Eventuell brauche ich einen neuen Assistenten.","en":"Maybe I need a new assistant.","words":[null,{"g":"to need","l":"brauchen"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"a","l":"ein"},{"g":"new","l":"neu"},{"g":"assistant","l":"Assistent"}]},{"text":"Am Nachmittag schneit es eventuell.","en":"It may snow in the afternoon.","words":[{"g":"at the / on the"},{"g":"afternoon"},{"g":"to snow","l":"schneien"},{"g":"it"},null]},{"text":"Eventuell werde ich ein paar Minuten später kommen.","en":"I might be a few minutes late.","words":[null,{"g":"to become","l":"werden"},{"g":"I"},null,null,{"g":"minute (unit of time","l":"Minute"},{"g":"later"},{"g":"to come"}],"phrases":[[3,5,"some"]]}]}